# EduGenie: Google Gemini Powered Learning Assistant

 ## Project – Planning

 ### 1\. Introduction

 Project planning is the process of defining the activities, resources, schedule, responsibilities, and milestones required to successfully develop **EduGenie: Google Gemini Powered Learning Assistant**.

 The project aims to develop an AI-powered learning platform that integrates **Google Gemini** to provide students with interactive academic assistance, including AI tutoring, study-material summarization, quiz generation, answer evaluation, and learning-progress tracking.

---

 ## 2\. Project Goals

 The main goals of the EduGenie project are:

 - To develop an easy-to-use AI learning assistant.
- To integrate Google Gemini into an educational application.
- To provide conversational academic assistance.
- To generate quizzes and practice questions automatically.
- To summarize study materials.
- To evaluate student answers and provide feedback.
- To maintain learning history and progress.
- To create a secure, reliable, and scalable application.

---

 ## 3\. Project Scope

 ### In Scope

 The initial version of EduGenie will include:

 - Student registration and login
- Student dashboard
- AI-powered question answering
- Conversational AI tutor
- Study-material summarization
- Quiz generation
- Answer evaluation
- Learning history
- Basic progress tracking
- Gemini API integration

 ### Out of Scope for Initial Version

 The following can be considered future enhancements:

 - Full mobile application
- Real-time voice tutoring
- Advanced teacher management
- Live classroom functionality
- Advanced predictive analytics
- Integration with external learning-management systems

