 # 10\. Risk Management

 | Risk | Impact | Mitigation |
| --- | --- | --- |
| Gemini API unavailable | High | Implement error handling and retry/fallback messaging |
| API usage limitations | Medium/High | Monitor usage and optimize requests |
| Incorrect AI response | Medium | Encourage verification and provide appropriate context |
| Database failure | High | Use backups and error handling |
| Security vulnerability | High | Authentication, validation, secure configuration |
| Development delay | Medium | Use milestones and weekly progress reviews |
| Integration problems | Medium | Test modules individually before integration |
| UI compatibility issues | Low/Medium | Test across browsers and screen sizes |

