 # 13\. Development Methodology

 An **iterative development approach** can be used for EduGenie.

 Instead of implementing every feature at once, the system can be developed in small increments:

```
Iteration 1
Authentication + Dashboard
        ↓
Iteration 2
AI Tutor
        ↓
Iteration 3
Summarization
        ↓
Iteration 4
Quiz Generator
        ↓
Iteration 5
Answer Evaluation
        ↓
Iteration 6
History + Progress
        ↓
Testing + Refinement
```

 This approach allows individual features to be tested and improved before the final integration.

